{
  "id": "E361",
  "title": "Feel Good",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-09-20",
  "synopsis": "What do Chinese people say when they feel good?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1157/0977fcc1ba70dc3f8cacd29ea2cf6b2ff1edb534.mp3?1568623429",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "爽\n\n保罗：上次我买的彩票，中了五百万！\n小乐：哇，太爽了！你现在是有钱人了，你打算做什么？\n保罗：我要辞职！我再也不想干这个工作了。\n小乐：太爽了！辞职以后呢？\n保罗：辞职以后，我要去全世界旅游！\n小乐：爽！\n保罗：我还要买两辆宝马，一辆白天开，一辆晚上开。\n小乐：爽！还有呢？\n保罗：我要买两套房子，想住哪套就住哪套！\n小乐：爽！\n（嘟嘟嘟，闹钟响了）\n保罗：原来是个梦啊……",
    "traditional": "爽\n\n保羅：上次我買的彩票，中了五百萬！\n小樂：哇，太爽了！你現在是有錢人了，你打算做什麼？\n保羅：我要辭職！我再也不想幹這個工作了。\n小樂：太爽了！辭職以後呢？\n保羅：辭職以後，我要去全世界旅遊！\n小樂：爽！\n保羅：我還要買兩輛寶馬，一輛白天開，一輛晚上開。\n小樂：爽！還有呢？\n保羅：我要買兩套房子，想住哪套就住哪套！\n小樂：爽！\n（嘟嘟嘟，鬧鐘響了）\n保羅：原來是個夢啊……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Feel Good"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：上次我买的彩票，中了五百万！",
      "traditional": "保羅：上次我買的彩票，中了五百萬！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shàng cì wǒ mǎi de cǎi piào zhòng le wǔ bǎi wàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: That lottery ticket I bought last time, it got five million!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：哇，太爽了！你现在是有钱人了，你打算做什么？",
      "traditional": "小樂：哇，太爽了！你現在是有錢人了，你打算做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wā tài shuǎng le nǐ xiàn zài shì yǒu qián rén le nǐ dǎ suàn zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Wow, that’s great! Now that you’re rich, what do you plan to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我要辞职！我再也不想干这个工作了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我要辭職！我再也不想幹這個工作了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ yào cí zhí wǒ zài yě bù xiǎng gàn zhè ge gōng zuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I’m going to quit! I don’t want to do this job anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：太爽了！辞职以后呢？",
      "traditional": "小樂：太爽了！辭職以後呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tài shuǎng le cí zhí yǐ hòu ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: That’s great! And after quitting?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：辞职以后，我要去全世界旅游！",
      "traditional": "保羅：辭職以後，我要去全世界旅遊！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó cí zhí yǐ hòu wǒ yào qù quán shì jiè lǚ yóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: After quitting my job, I am going to travel the whole world!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：爽！",
      "traditional": "小樂：爽！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Fabulous!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：我还要买两辆宝马，一辆白天开，一辆晚上开。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我還要買兩輛寶馬，一輛白天開，一輛晚上開。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ hái yào mǎi liǎng liàng bǎo mǎ yí liàng bái tiān kāi yí liàng wǎn shang kāi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I’ll also buy two BMW’s, and drive one by day and one by night."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小乐：爽！还有呢？",
      "traditional": "小樂：爽！還有呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuǎng hái yǒu ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Cool! Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "保罗：我要买两套房子，想住哪套就住哪套！",
      "traditional": "保羅：我要買兩套房子，想住哪套就住哪套！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ yào mǎi liǎng tào fáng zi xiǎng zhù nǎ tào jiù zhù nǎ tào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I want to buy two houses, and stay in whichever house I want!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小乐：爽！",
      "traditional": "小樂：爽！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Amazing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "（嘟嘟嘟，闹钟响了）",
      "traditional": "（嘟嘟嘟，鬧鐘響了）",
      "pinyin": "dū dū dū nào zhōng xiǎng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(Beep-beep-beep, the alarm clock rang)"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "保罗：原来是个梦啊……",
      "traditional": "保羅：原來是個夢啊……",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yuán lái shì ge mèng a",
      "english": ""
